            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0546" n="500" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg500"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.11/343a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-24T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1917—6 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department is not sending to you the text of the Pan American treaty which you
                    were informed prior to your departure from the United States would be cabled to
                    you, as it does not desire you to take up this question with the Government of
                    Brazil at this time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
